    "detailed_description": "Puzzle Girls: Alexa is a puzzle game, in which all you need is to swap tiles, in order to complete the pictured artwork.<br>Featuring artwork from the Dharker Studio game: Alexa's Wild Night.<br><br>A relaxing puzzle game to have fun with.<br><br>The base game is completely free to play and includes safe for work images from the original game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A selection of puzzle art to unlock and enjoy.<br></li><li>Multiple difficulty settings to make the puzzles more complex<br></li><li>Swap Tiles, Rotate tiles &amp; flip tiles horizontally and vertically to complete the puzzles.<br></li><li>One handed gaming for easier <strong><i>play</i></strong>!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bonus Features via DLC:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unlockable Art Gallery (to view completed illustration puzzles)<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Many additional images of an adult nature<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>More content and puzzles</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>",
